put meta 398 mm_v meta 1
put meta 399 mm_v meta 1
put meta 400 mm_v meta 2
put meta 401 mm_v meta 2
put meta 402 mm_v meta 2
put meta 403 mm_v meta 2
put meta 404 mm_v meta 2
put meta 405 mm_v meta 2
put meta 406 mm_v meta 2
put meta 407 mm_v meta 2
put meta 408 mm_v meta 4
for u ulong unr bound 8
  put meta add 410 u mm_v meta 4
  put meta add 418 u mm_v meta 2
end
end

fn mf_prologue ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 ks ulong n ulong to void
mm_prologue_hdr ins meta
put meta 18 0
mm_ld_base ins meta OP_MOV_IMM get meta 396 1
mm_shf_lop ins meta get meta 388 get meta 391 get meta 392
mm_imad ins meta get meta 393 get meta 392 2
put meta 16 get meta 391
put meta 17 0
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 394 get meta 390 16
put meta 16 get meta 394
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 395 get meta 396 8
put meta 16 get meta 388
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 390 mul ks 32
put meta 16 get meta 384
mm_imadw ins meta get meta 400 get meta 397 16
mm_imad ins meta get meta 398 get meta 389 1
put meta 16 get meta 388
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 398 mul ks 32
put meta 16 get meta 385
mm_imadw ins meta get meta 401 get meta 397 8
put meta 16 get meta 393
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 394 n
put meta 16 get meta 397
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 398 8
put meta 16 get meta 386
mm_imadw ins meta get meta 402 get meta 397 4
put meta 16 get meta 393
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 395 n
put meta 16 get meta 397
mm_imad3 ins meta get meta 397 get meta 398 8
put meta 16 get meta 386
mm_imadw ins meta get meta 403 get meta 397 4
