put meta 16 get meta 401
mm_imadw ins meta get meta 401 get meta 396 mul mul mul get sp 4 get sp 7 div get sp 1 16 256
mm_isetp_ge ins meta get meta 398 div get sp 2 8
mm_bra_back ins meta get meta 23 6
put meta 24 sub get meta 0 1
